{
  "slug": "learning-tutor",
  "name": "Learning Tutor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-powered personal tutor plugin for Claude Code. Features adaptive teaching with 3 styles (progressive, Socratic, structured), pre/post testing with generative questions, spaced repetition across sessions, persistent learner profiles with proficiency tracking (levels 1-5), and teaching guardrails (hard stops, anti-rationalization). Supports bilingual teaching (Chinese/English).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `learning-tutor` (Use when the user wants to learn, study, review, or understand any topic) and **1 hook**, `Stop`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install learning-tutor@claude-community` from `shauigewhite/learning-tutor`.\n\nAn AI-powered personal tutor plugin for Claude Code. Turns Claude into an adaptive learning companion with structured pedagogy, spaced repetition, and persistent learner profiles.",
